2 CONT René de Brosse, also René de Bretagne was the elder son of Jean III de Brosse and Louise de Laval. He was killed at the Battle of Pavia on 24 February 1525. The Battle of Pavia, fought on the morning of 24 February 1525, was the d
2 CONC ecisive engagement of the Italian War of 1521–26. http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Pavia
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the father of Jean IV de Brosse and three daughters.
