2 CONT LITERATURE The Princess of Montpensier , story by Madame de Lafayette . The news is purely fictional, there has never been a princess in the family but Montpensier dukes. The author may have given this princely title since Françoi
2 CONC s Duc de Montpensier was prince of the blood (Bourbon). The love affair between the various characters are imaginary, like the names of the characters. It inspired a French film The Princess of Montpensier ( 2010 ), directed by Be
2 CONC rtrand Tavernier . The Prince of Montpensier is interpreted by Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet .
