2 CONT Catherine de Nevers by Jean Clouet 1     Catherine de Nevers was born in 1548. She was the daughter of François de Cleves, Duc de Nevers and Margaret de Vendôme. She married, firstly, Antoine de Croy, Prince de Pocien in 1560. She
2 CONC  married, secondly, Henri I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise, son of François I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise and Anna d'Este, in 1570. She died in 1633.
2 CONT      Her married name became de Croy. Children of Catherine de Nevers and Henri I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise 1.Charles de Lorraine, Duc de Guise+ b. 1571, d. 1640 2.Henri de Guise b. 1572, d. 1574 3.Catherine de Guise b. 1573, d. 1
2 CONC 573 4.Louis de Guise b. 1575, d. 1621 5.Charles de Guise b. 1576, d. 1576 6.Marie de Guise b. 1577, d. 1582 7.Claude de Guise, Duc de Chevreuse b. 1578, d. 1657 8.Catherine de Guise b. 1579 9.Christine de Guise b. 1580, d. 1580 10
2 CONC .François de Guise b. 1581, d. 1582 11.Renee de Guise b. 1585, d. 1626 12.Jeanne de Guise b. 1586, d. 1638 13.Louise de Guise b. 1588, d. 1631 14.François de Guise b. 1589, d. 1614 Citations 1.[S3409] Caroline Maubois, "re: Penanc
2 CONC oet Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 2 December 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Penancoet Family."
