2 CONT and maternal granddaughter of Sébastien de Ploeuc, Marquis de Timeur, and his wife (married on 8 January 1617) Marie de Rieux (d. 1628).
2 CONT
2 CONT The name Kérouaille was derived from an heiress whom an ancestor François de Penhoët had married in 1330.
