1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===Violante Margherita di Savoia (1)
2 CONT *F, #114446, b. 15 November 1635, d. 29 April 1663
2 CONT *Last Edited=9 Mar 2007
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=1.84%
2 CONT
2 CONT Violante Margherita di Savoia was born on 15 November 1635. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Vittorio Amadeo I, Duca di Savoia and Marie Christine de Bourbon, Princesse de France. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Rainuzzio II Farnese, Duca di Parma, son of Odoardo Farnese, Duca di Parma and Margherita de Medici, in 1660. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 29 April 1663 at age 27.
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p11445.htm#i114446
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SAVOY.htm#VictorAmedeeIdied1637B
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.         YOLANDE MARGUERITE de Savoie (15 Nov 1635-29 Apr 1663).  m (29 Apr 1660) as his first wife, RANUCCIO II Farnese Duke of Parma and Piacenza, son of ODOARDO I Farnese Duke of Parma and Piacenza & his wife Margherita de’ M
2 CONC edici Pss of Tuscany (Cortemaggiore or Casalmaggiore 17 Sep 1630-Parma 11 Dec 1694). 
2 CONT
2 CONT
