2 CONC tain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 250. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family. 5.[S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families o
2 CONC f Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown and Company, 1999), table 134. Hereinafter cited as Lines of Succession.
