2 CONT Louise Renée de Penancoët de Kérouaille, Duchess of Portsmouth (September 1649 – 14 November 1734) was a mistress of Charles II of England. Through her son by Charles II, Charles Lennox, 1st Duke of Richmond, she is ancestress of 
2 CONC both wives of Prince Charles: Lady Diana Spencer and Camilla Shand.
2 CONT
