1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Francesco III d'Este, Duca di Modena (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #113751, b. 2 July 1698, d. 22 February 1780
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=4 Mar 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.07%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Francesco III d'Este, Duca di Modena was born on 2 July 1698 at Modena, Italy. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Rinaldo III d'Este, Duca di Modena and Charlotte Felicitas Herzogin von Braunschweig-Lüneburg. (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Charlotte Aglaé d'Orléans, daughter of Philippe II d'Orléans, Duc d'Orléans and Françoise Marie de Bourbon, on 21 July 1720 at Modena, Italy. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Teresa di Castellborco. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Charlotte Aglaé d'Orléans, daughter of Philippe II d'Orléans, Duc d'Orléans and Françoise Marie de Bourbon, on 12 February 1720 at Tuileries, Paris, France, in a proxy marriage. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 22 February 1780 at age 81 at Varese, Italy. (3) He was buried at Capuchin Convent, Varese, Italy. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Francesco III d'Este, Duca di Modena succeeded to the title of Duca di Modena in 1737. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Francesco III d'Este, Duca di Modena and Charlotte Aglaé d'Orléans
