2 CONT Louis Victor, Prince of Carignan
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Victor
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince of Carignan
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	Christine of Hesse-Rotenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT Detail
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue
