1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria Teresa Antonietta Rafael de Borbón, Infanta de España (1) F, #105791, b. 11 June 1726, d. 22 July 1746 Last Edited=21 Sep 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Teresa Antonietta Rafael de Borbón, Infanta de España was born on 11 June 1726 at Madrid, Spain. (1) She was the daughter of Felipe V de Borbón, Rey de España and Isabella Elizabeth Farnese. (1) She married Louis Ferdinand d
2 CONC e Bourbon, Dauphin de France, son of Louis XV, Roi de France and Marie Charlotte Sophie Leszczynska, Princess of Poland, on 23 February 1745 at Versailles, Île-de-France, France. (1) She married Louis Ferdinand de Bourbon, Dauphin
2 CONC  de France, son of Louis XV, Roi de France and Marie Charlotte Sophie Leszczynska, Princess of Poland, on 18 December 1744 at Madrid, Spain, in a proxy marriage. (1)  She died on 22 July 1746 at age 20 at Versailles, Île-de-France
2 CONC , France, in childbirth. (1) She was buried at Saint-Denis, Île-de-France, France. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Teresa Antonietta Rafael de Borbón, Infanta de España was a member of the House of Bourbon. She gained the title of Infanta de España. Child of Maria Teresa Antonietta Rafael de Borbón, Infanta de España and Louis Ferdinand 
2 CONC de Bourbon, Dauphin de France -1. Marie Thérèse de Bourbon (1) b. 19 Jul 1746, d. 27 Apr 1748
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://thepeerage.com/p10580.htm thepeerage.com...] ; [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maria_Teresa_Rafaela_of_Spain en.wikipedia.org...] ;  Infanta Maria Teresa Rafaela of Spain From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia (Redirected fro
2 CONC m Maria Teresa Rafaela of Spain) Marie Thérèse Raphaëlle Dauphine of France Marie Thérèse in 1745 by Louis Tocqué Spouse 	Louis, Dauphin of France Issue Marie Thérèse de France Full name French: Marie Thérèse Antoinette Raphaëlle 
2 CONC d'Espagne Spanish: María Teresa Antonia Rafaela de España House 	House of Bourbon Father 	Philip V of Spain Mother 	Elisabeth Farnese Born 	11 June 1726 La Granja Palace, San Ildefonso, Spain Died 	22 July 1746 (aged 20 ) Palace o
2 CONC f Versailles, France Burial 	Basilica of St Denis, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Teresa Rafaela of Spain (María Teresa Antonia Rafaela; 11 June 1726 – 22 July 1746) became Dauphine of France when she married Louis, Dauphin of France. She died in childbirth aged 20, leaving no surviving descendants. Conte
2 CONC nts [show]
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 1 Biography
2 CONT           o 1.1 Marriage
