2 CONC own as Maria Antonia or just Antonia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her current descendants include the pretending Duke of Parma and the reigning Grand Duke of Luxembourg. They are members of family named the Bourbon's of Parma. She is also an ancestor of the Duke of Bavaria.
2 CONT
