1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikiwand.com/en/Maria_Teresa_Cybo-Malaspina,_Duchess_of_Massa
2 CONT
2 CONT Donna Maria Teresa Cibo, Duchessa di Massa e Carrara (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #846, b. 29 June 1721, d. 26 December 1790
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=20 Oct 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Donna Maria Teresa Cibo, Duchessa di Massa e Carrara was born on 29 June 1721. She was the daughter of Alderano Cibo, Duca di Massa e Carrara and Ricciarda Gonzaga di Novellara. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Ercole III d'Este, Duca di Modena, son of Francesco III d'Este, Duca di Modena and Charlotte Aglaé d'Orléans, on 16 April 1741. She died on 26 December 1790 at age 69 at Reggio.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Donna Maria Teresa Cibo, Duchesa di Massa e Carrara gained the title of Duchesa di Massa.1 She gained the title of Duchessa di Carrara.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Donna Maria Teresa Cibo, Duchessa di Massa e Carrara and Ercole III d'Este, Duca di Modena
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Maria Beatrice d'Este, Duchessa di Modena+ b. 7 Apr 1750, d. 14 Nov 1829 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Rinaldo Francesco d'Este b. 4 Jan 1753, d. 5 May 1753 
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p85.htm
