1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT "Henrietta Louisa Fermor (née Jeffreys), Countess of Pomfret (died 15 December 1761), was an English letter writer. She was the only surviving child of John Jeffreys, 2nd Baron Jeffreys of Wem, Shropshire, by his wife, Lady Charlo
2 CONC tte Herbert, daughter and heiress of Philip, Earl of Pembroke and Montgomery (by his wife, Henriette de Kérouaille, sister of Charles II's mistress Louise, Duchess of Portsmouth)."
2 CONT
