2 CONT Charles Emmanuel IV of Sardinia
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles Emmanuel IV
2 CONT
