1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * full name: Maximilian Maria Joseph Anton Johann Baptist Johann Evangelista Ignaz Augustin Xavier Aloys Johann Nepomuk Januar Hermenegild Agnellis Paschalis
2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maximilian,_Crown_Prince_of_Saxony '''http://en.wikipedia....''']
2 CONT * Maximilian Prinz von Sachsen was born on 13 April 1759. He was the son of Friedrich Christian Leopold Kurfürst von Sachsen and Maria Antonia Prinzessin von Bayern. (1) He married, secondly, Maria Luisa Carlota di Borbone, Princi
2 CONC pessa di Parma, daughter of Luigi I di Borbone, King of Etruria and Maria Luisa de Borbón, Infanta de España, on 7 November 1825. He married, firstly, Carolina Maria di Borbone, Principessa di Parma, daughter of Ferdinando I di Bo
2 CONC rbone, Duca di Parma and Marie Amalie Erzherzogin von Österreich, on 9 May 1792. 
2 CONT * He died on 3 January 1838 at age 78.
2 CONT * Maximilian Prinz von Sachsen gained the title of Prinz von Sachsen. (1)
2 CONT * Children of Maximilian Prinz von Sachsen and Carolina Maria di Borbone, Principessa di Parma
2 CONT
