1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.thepeerage.com/p1194.htm#i11935]
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Emilia Mary Lennox was born on 6 October 1731.  She was the daughter of General Charles Lennox, 2nd Duke of Richmond and Lady Sarah Cadogan.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, Lt.-Gen. James FitzGerald, 1st Duke of Leinster, son of Robert FitzGerald, 19th Earl of Kildare and Lady Mary O'Brien, on 7 February 1747.3  She married, secondly, William Ogilvie in 1774.3 She died on 27 Mar
2 CONC ch 1814 at age 82 at London, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT      As a result of her marriage, Lady Emilia Mary Lennox was styled as Countess of Kildare on 7 February 1747. From 7 February 1747, her married name became FitzGerald. As a result of her marriage, Lady Emilia Mary Lennox was sty
2 CONC led as Marchioness of Kildare on 3 March 1761. As a result of her marriage, Lady Emilia Mary Lennox was styled as Duchess of Leinster on 22 December 1766. She gained the title of Dowager Duchess of Leinster on 19 November 1773. Fr
2 CONC om 1774, her married name became Ogilvie.3
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Lady Emilia Mary Lennox and William Ogilvie
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Emily Charlotte Ogilvie+ d. 22 Jan 1832
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Emilia Mary Lennox and Lt.-Gen. James FitzGerald, 1st Duke of Leinster
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Lady Sophia Sarah Mary FitzGerald d. 21 Mar 18454
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.Lady Lucy Anne FitzGerald d. 18514
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.George FitzGerald, Earl of Offaly b. 15 Jan 1748, d. 26 Sep 17654
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.William Robert FitzGerald, 2nd Duke of Leinster+ b. 12 Mar 1748/49, d. 20 Oct 18044
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.Lady Emily Maria Margaret FitzGerald+ b. 15 Mar 1751, d. 8 Apr 18181
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.Rear-Admiral Charles James FitzGerald, 1st and last Baron Lecale of Ardglass+ b. 30 Jun 1756, d. 18 Feb 18104
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.Lady Charlotte Mary Gertrude FitzGerald, Baroness Rayleigh+ b. 29 May 1758, d. 12 Sep 18364
2 CONT
2 CONT 8.Lord Henry FitzGerald+ b. 30 Jul 1761, d. 9 Jul 18294
2 CONT
2 CONT 9.Lord Edward FitzGerald+ b. 15 Oct 1763, d. 4 Jun 17984
2 CONT
2 CONT 10.Lord Robert Stephen FitzGerald+ b. 1765, d. 2 Jan 18334
2 CONT
2 CONT 11.Lord Gerald FitzGerald b. c 1766, d. 17884
2 CONT
