1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier,_Duke_of_Aquitaine en.wikipedia.org...] ; 
2 CONT *Xavier Marie Joseph de France
2 CONT *Father 	Louis Ferdinand of France
2 CONT *Mother 	Princess Maria Josepha of Saxony
2 CONT *Born 	8 September 1753(1753-09-08), Palace of Versailles, France
2 CONT *Died 	22 February 1754 (aged 0), Palace of Versailles, France
2 CONT *Buried  Basilique Saint Denis, Saint-Denis, France
2 CONT *Xavier de France, fils de France, Duke of Aquitaine (Xavier Marie Joseph; 8 September 1753 – 22 February 1754) was a French Prince du Sang of the House of Bourbon.
2 CONT === Biography===
2 CONT *Xavier Marie Joseph de France, duc d'Aquitaine was the third surviving child and eldest son of Dauphin Louis Ferdinand of France and Princess Maria Josepha of Saxony. He was a brother to the future kings Louis XVI, Louis XVIII an
2 CONC d Charles X.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was put in the care of Marie Isabelle de Rohan, duchesse de Tallard.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was given the title of Duke of Aquitaine by his grandfather, Louis XV of France.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died at the age of six months at Versailles after a fit of convulsions. He was buried at the Basilica of St Denis.
2 CONT
