1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''LOUIS XVI KING OF FRANCE & CO-PRINCE OF ANDORRA'''
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.historiesajten.se/visainfo.asp?id=379
2 CONT *[http://thepeerage.com/p10207.htm#i102066 The Peerage] 
2 CONT *'''Wikipedia:''' [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_XVI_of_France English ][http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_XVI_de_France Francais] '''King of the French''' Reign	1 October 1791 – 21 September 1792
2 CONT >'''Predecessor'''[http://www.geni.com/people/index/5318307072010126343 Louis XV] '''Successor:'''  Monarchy abolished Next reigning monarch in France was Napoleon I starting 1804.
2 CONT *[http://www.fsigenetics.com/article/PIIS1872497310001602/ Louis is assumed to have belonged to Y-DNA haplogroup G2a]
2 CONT
2 CONT "The rule of France by men of the House of Bourbon began with King Henri IV in 1589 C.E. and continued until the beheading of his direct paternal descendant King Louis XVI in 1793. Several years ago, researchers analyzed a mummifi
2 CONC ed head and a blood-soaked cloth that they believed might belong to the two kings, and concluded that the royal paternal line belonged to haplogroup G. In a more recent study, however, a different set of researchers tested three l
2 CONC iving men who are direct descendants of the Bourbon kings. Their efforts revealed that the male lineage of the House of Bourbon is actually a branch of haplogroup R-M405." (23&me, 2020)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Ludvig XVI (23. elokuuta 1754, Versailles – 21. tammikuuta 1793, Pariisi) oli Ranskan ja Navarran kuningas (1774–1789) ja ranskalaisten kuningas (1789–1792).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludvig Augustus oli Ranskan kruununperillisen, dauphin Ludvigin (1729–1765) poika. Hänen äitinsä, dauphinin toinen puoliso, oli Maria Josepha von Sachsen (1731–1767), jonka isä oli Saksin vaaliruhtinas Friedrich August II (1733–17
2 CONC 63), Puolan kuninkaana nimellä Augustus III (1734–1763), sekä äiti Maria-Josepha von Habsburg. Näin Ludvig Augustus oli Ranskan kuninkaan Ludvig XV:n ja tämän puolison Marie Leszczyńskan pojanpoika. Syntyessään hän sai arvokseen B
2 CONC erryn herttuan tittelin, jota hän kantoi aina isänsä 20. joulukuuta 1765 tapahtuneeseen kuolemaan saakka. Tämän jälkeen hänestä tuli kruununperillinen, sillä hänen vanhempi veljensä Burgundin herttua Ludvig Josef oli kuollut jo ai
2 CONC emmin (1751–1761). Ludvig Augustuksesta tuli kuningas Ludvig XVI 10. toukokuuta 1774
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludvig Augustus avioitui 16. toukokuuta 1770 Versaillesissa, Reimsin arkkipiispa-herttuan toimittamassa seremoniassa Itävallan arkkiherttuattaren Marie-Antoinetten (1755–1793) kanssa. Hänen vanhempansa olivat Pyhän saksalais-rooma
2 CONC laisen keisarikunnan keisari Frans I ja keisarinna Maria Teresia, joka oli myös Unkarin, Böömin kuningatar sekä Itävallan hallitseva arkkiherttuatar.
2 CONT
2 CONT Avioliitosta syntyivät lapset Marie-Thérèse Charlotte (1778–1851), eli kuninkaallinen Madame, joka avioitui sukulaisensa Angoulêmen herttuan (1775–1844) kanssa Louis-Joseph-Xavier-François (1781–1789), ensimmäinen dauphin Louis-Ch
2 CONC arles (1785–1795), toinen dauphin ja tuleva kuningas Ludvig XVII Sophie-Beatrix (1786–1787)
2 CONT
2 CONT *~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis XVI (August 23, 1754, Versailles - 21 january, 1793, Paris) was French, and the king of Navarre (1774-1789) and the King of the French (1789-1792).
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Augustus was the son of the French heir to the throne, dauphin Louis (1729-1765). His mother, Dauphin's second wife, was Maria Josepha von Sachsen (1731-1767), whose father was a Saxon Elector Friedrich August II (1733-1763)
2 CONC , the Polish king at Augustus III (1734-1763), as well as the mother of Maria-Josepha von Habsburg . Thus Louis Augustus was the King of France, Louis XV and his wife Marie Leszczynski grandson. At birth, he received the level of 
2 CONC importance of the Duke of Berry's title, which he always wore his father until December 20, 1765's death. Subsequently, he became heir to the throne, because his older brother, Duke of Burgundy Ludwig Josef had died in the past (1
2 CONC 751-1761). Louis Augustus became King Louis XVI on 10 May 1774
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Augustus married on 16 May 1770 in Versailles, submitted by the Archbishop of Reims, the Duke of the ceremony with the Austrian arkkiherttuattaren Marie-Antoinette (1755-1793). His parents were the Holy Roman Emperor Francis
2 CONC  I and Empress Maria Theresa, who was also Hungarian, Bohemian and Austrian reigning queen of archduchess.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage born children of Marie-Thérèse Charlotte (1778-1851), a royal Madame, who married the Duke of Angoulême with relatives (1775-1844) Louis-Joseph-Xavier-François (1781-1789), the first dauphin Louis-Charles (1785-1795 ), th
2 CONC e second dauphin and future King Louis XVII Sophie-Beatrix (1786-1787)
2 CONT
2 CONT  WikiTree   FREE   Birth:	Aug 23 1754 - Versailles, France Death:	Jan 21 1793 - Place de la Révolution, Paris, France Parents:	Louis Ferdinand de France, Maria Josepha Caroline Eleanore Franziska Bourbon Wife:	Maria Antonia Joseph
2 CONC a Johanna de France Child:	Louis-Charles de France Siblings:	Charles Bourbon, King Louis Stanislas Xavier de France
2 CONT
2 CONT __________ Louis XVII listed as "the uncrowned king of France"
