2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/profile/index/6000000000350830758 Leopold II] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/index/6000000000951436798 Ferdinand I] 
2 CONT *'''Holy Roman Emperor, King in Germany:''' Reign 5 July 1792 – 6 August 1806 Coronation 14 July 1792, Frankfurt  
