2 CONT      Felipe Francesco de Borbón was born on 5 September 1783. He was the son of Carlos IV, Rey de España and Maria Luisa di Borbone, Principessa di Parma. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 18 October 1784 at age 1.
