2 CONT
2 CONT Children/ Child By Maria Isabel of Portugal (1797–1818) Infanta María Luisa Isabel	21 August 1817 Madrid	9 January 1818 Madrid	El Escorial	 Infanta María Luisa Isabel	26 December 1818 Madrid	El Escorial	Stillborn; Maria Isabel die
2 CONC d as a result of her birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children/ Child By Maria Christina of the Two Sicilies (1806–1878) Infanta María Isabel Luisa	10 October 1830 Madrid	10 April 1904 Paris	El Escorial	Princess of Asturias 1830–1833, Queen of Spain 1833–1868. Married Francis, Duke o
2 CONC f Cádiz, had issue. Infanta María Luisa Fernanda	30 January 1832 Madrid	2 February 1897 Seville	El Escorial	Married Antoine, Duke of Montpensier, had issue
