1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Golden Fleece - Knights: Spanish Branch===
2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leopold,_Prince_of_Salerno '''en.wikipedia....'''], [http://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leopoldo_di_Borbone-Napoli '''it.wikipedia....''']
2 CONT * Prince Leopoldo Giovanni Giuseppe Michele of Bourbon-Two Sicilies, Prince of Salerno -(2 July 1790, Naples, Kingdom of Naples – 10 March 1851, Naples, Kingdom of the Two Sicilies, was a member of the House of Bourbon-Two Sicilie
2 CONC s and a Prince of Bourbon-Two Sicilies.
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT * Born Leopoldo of Naples and Sicily, he was the sixth son of Ferdinand IV of Naples and wife Maria Carolina of Austria, daughter of Maria Theresa of Austria.
2 CONT ===Marriage and issue===
2 CONT * Leopold married his niece Archduchess Clementina of Austria, third surviving daughter of Francis II, Holy Roman Emperor (later Francis I of Austria) and his sister Maria Teresa of Naples and Sicily on 28 July 1816 at Schönbrunn 
2 CONC Palace in Vienna. Leopold and Clementina had four children but only their daughter Princess Maria Carolina survived infancy. Prince Louis and two infants died within their first year.
2 CONT >#  Prince Lodovico Carlos of the Two Sicilies (1824)
2 CONT >#  Princess Maria Carolina of the Two Sicilies (26 April 1822 - 6 December 1869) ∞ HRH Prince Henri, Duke of Aumale on 25 November 1844
2 CONT
2 CONT >># Louis Philippe Marie Léopold d'Orléans, Prince of Condé (15 November 1845 - 24 May 1866)
2 CONT >># Henri Léopold Philippe Marie d'Orléans, Duke of Guise (11 September 1847 - 10 October 1847)
2 CONT >># François Paul d'Orléans, Duke of Guise (11 January 1852 - 15 April 1852)
2 CONT >># François Louis Philippe Marie d'Orléans, Duke of Guise (5 January 1854 - 25 July 1872)
