2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Archduchess Maria Theresa of Austria (March 20, 1762 – January 23, 1770) was a daughter of Joseph II, Holy Roman Emperor, and his first wife, Isabella of Parma. She died suddenly at age of seven of pleurisy. She is buried in the I
2 CONC mperial Crypt, like her parents and her stepmother.
