1 OCCU King of Etruria (28.7.1801-1803), he assumed this title in his father's lifetime, cr Infant of Spain 30.11.1795; Parma itself was conquered by Napoleon, and after Waterloo it was given to Napoleon's widow, to revert to the Bourbon
