1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Major, 87th Regiment of Foot 1779 and  
2 CONT * Lt Col 1780;  
2 CONT * a Lord of the Bedchamber (Tory) 1777-1812;  
2 CONT * Lord Lieutenant of Rutland 1779-1826;  
