2 CONT * Volume:	12
2 CONT * Page:	313 (click to see others on page)
2 CONT
2 CONT Will of Caroline Barker, Widow of Clare , Suffolk '''10 February 1848'''  (Record of this will is at the National Archives, London,  PROB 11/2068)
