2 CONT  Child:       Anastasie Louise Pauline MOTIER de la FAYETTE 
2 CONT
2 CONT --
2 CONT
2 CONT His 2-Great Grandchild:       Maria Christina dei Conti RIGNON 
2 CONT
2 CONT   His 5-Great Grandchild:       Philippe Leopold Louis Marie (Crown Prince) of BELGIUM 
2 CONT
2 CONT --
