2 CONT      Maria Luisa Carlota di Borbone, Principessa di Parma was born on 2 October 1802 at Barcelona, Spain. She was the daughter of Luigi I di Borbone, King of Etruria and Maria Luisa de Borbón, Infanta de España. (1) She married, f
2 CONC irstly, Maximilian Prinz von Sachsen, son of Friedrich Christian Leopold Kurfürst von Sachsen and Maria Antonia Prinzessin von Bayern, on 7 November 1825. She married, secondly, Francesco Rossi, Conte Rossi on 22 July 1849. She ma
2 CONC rried, thirdly, Cavaliere Giovanni Vimercati on 19 February 1855. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 18 March 1857 at age 54 at Rome, Italy.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maria Luisa Carlota di Borbone, Principessa di Parma gained the title of Principessa Maria Luisa di Parma.
