2 CONT
2 CONT Sisarukset: Infanta Luisa Fernanda, Duchess of Montpensier,  María Amparo Muñoz, 1st Countess of Vista Alegre, Agustín Muñoz, 1st Duke of Tarancón, Fernando, 2nd Duke of Riansares and Tarancon, Maria Christina, Marchioness of La I
2 CONC sabella, Maria de los Milagros, Marchioness of Castillejo, Jose, Count of Gracia, Juan, Count of Recuerdo
