1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Konstantin Alexander Joseph Prinz zu Salm-Salm 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #96879, b. 22 November 1762, d. 25 February 1828
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=17 Aug 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Konstantin Alexander Joseph Prinz zu Salm-Salm was born on 22 November 1762. He was the son of Maximilian Friedrich Ernst Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Marie Luise Eleonore Landgräfin von Hessen-Rheinfels-Rottenburg. He married, fir
2 CONC stly, Viktoria Felizitas Prinzessin zu Löwenstein-Wertheim-Rochefort on 31 December 1782 at Püttlingen, England. He married, secondly, Maria Walburga Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid, daughter of Philipp Christian Graf von Sternb
2 CONC erg and Augusta Leopoldine Gräfin von Manderscheid-Blankenheim, on 4 February 1788 at Vinac, Bohemia. He married, thirdly, Catherina Bender on 12 June 1810. He died on 25 February 1828 at age 65.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Konstantin Alexander Joseph Prinz zu Salm-Salm gained the title of Prinz zu Salm-Salm.
2 CONT
