1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She was the wife of Admiral Sir Thomas Masterman Hardy, who was on HMS Victory when Nelson was killed at the Battle of Trafalgar.
2 CONT
2 CONT When she heard that HMS Victory was to be scrapped, she was so appalled that she made her husband go back to the Admiralty and rescind the order, so she is responsible for the fact that we can still see HMS Victory at Portsmouth H
2 CONC arbour today!. Bravo to that lady!
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMS_Victory
