2 CONT
2 CONT 7th Duke of Bedford
2 CONT 7th Marquess of Tavistock
2 CONT 11th Earl of Bedford
2 CONT 12th Baron Russell
2 CONT 9th Baron Russell of Thornbaugh
2 CONT 7th Baron Howland of Streatham
2 CONT Knight of the Garter
2 CONT
2 CONT Eldest son of John Russell, 6th Duke of Bedford, and the Honourable Georgiana Elizabeth Byng. Paternal grandson of Francis Russell, Marquess of Tavistock, and Lady Elizabeth Keppel. Maternal grandson of George Byng, 4th Viscount T
2 CONC orrington, and Lady Lucy Boyle.
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis is a direct descendant of King Charles II through his paternal grandmother, and was the elder brother of British Prime Minister John Russell, 1st Earl Russell.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lady Anna Maria Stanhope in 1808, the daughter of the 3rd Earl of Harrington.
2 CONT
2 CONT The marriage produced a son named William, who succeeded his father as duke.
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis is interred in the Bedford Chapel of the parish Church of St. Michael, Chenies.
