2 CONT
2 CONT * Name: Elizabeth Jane Townshend (née Stuart)
2 CONT * Born: Monday, 18 July 1803, Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India
2 CONT * Died: Saturday, 27 January 1877 (aged 73), Marylebone, London, England
2 CONT * Buried: [All Saints with Saint John Churchyard, Queen's Road, Hertford, Hertfordshire SG13 8AY 51.79500, -0.07573], England
2 CONT * Inscription: (tidied)
2 CONT ** Sacred to the memory of
2 CONT ** Elizabeth Jane Townshend,
2 CONT ** widow of Rear Admiral John Townshend, 4th Marquis Townshend,
2 CONT ** and eldest daughter of Rear Admiral Lord George Stuart,
2 CONT ** who was born Monday, 18 July 1803,
2 CONT ** and whose spirit, loved and lamented,
2 CONT ** left this world Saturday, 27 January 1877.
2 CONT ** Farewell with honour, peace and love.
2 CONT ** Be thy dear memory blest.
2 CONT * About: Daughter of Rear-Admiral Lord George Stuart and Jane Lewis (née Stewart) Stuart. Married Rear-Admiral John Townshend 4th Marquess Townshend on Thursday, 18 August 1825, died 1863. Children:Anne Maria Townshend 1827-1899Jo
