1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Mary Davis (Easton/Eastin)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/103443291/mary-davis Find A Grave Memorial ID # 103443291]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was the Mother of General Reuben E Davis, U.S. Representative 
2 CONT
2 CONT In his book: "Recollections of Mississippi and Mississippians" he states:
2 CONT
2 CONT "My mother died when I was about twelve years old and the grief which this loss occasioned, shadowed my existence for years. She was a woman of great tenderness and sweetness of character and I was passionately devoted to her. Thr
2 CONC ough my whole life I have carried the most affectionate memory of her in my heart."
2 CONT
