2 CONT      Franz Josef Erzherzog von Österreich was born on 5 March 1855 at Gross-Seelowitz, Morav. ▼1, ▼2 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Karl Ferdinand Erzherzog von Österreich and Elizabeth Franziska Maria Erzherzogin von Österreich. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 13 March 1855 at Gross-Seelowitz, Morav. ▼1, ▼2 He was buried at Capuchin Church, Vienna, Austria. ▼1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Franz Josef Erzherzog von Österreich was a member of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine. He gained the title of Erzherzog von Österreich (styled as HI&RH Archduke of Austria). ▼1
