2 CONT
2 CONT      Eugen Ferdinand Erzherzog von Österreich was born on 21 May 1863 at Gross-Seelowitz, Morav. ▼1 He was the son of Karl Ferdinand Erzherzog von Österreich and Elizabeth Franziska Maria Erzherzogin von Österreich. ▼1
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 30 December 1954 at age 91 at Meran, Austria. ▼1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Eugen Ferdinand Erzherzog von Österreich was a member of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine. He gained the title of Erzherzog von Österreich (styled as HI&RH Archduke of Austria). ▼1 He was baptised with the name of Eugen Ferdina
2 CONC nd Pius Bernhard Felix Maria. ▼2 He held the office of Grand Master of the Teutonic Order between 1894 and 1923, in the Austria Empire. ▼2 He gained the rank of General Field Marshal in the service of the Austrian Army. ▼2
2 CONT
