2 CONT      Alfonso XII de Borbón y de Borbón, Rey de España was born on 28 November 1857 at Madrid, Spain. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Francisco de Asis de Borbón, Duque de Cádiz and Isabel II, Reina de España. He married, firstly, Maria de las Mercedes de Orléans y de Borbón, Infanta de España, daughter of Antoine Marie Philippe Louis d'Orléans
2 CONC , Prince d'Orléans and Maria Luisa Fernanda de Borbón, Infanta de España, on 23 January 1878 at Madrid, Spain. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Maria Cristina Erzherzogin von Österreich, daughter of Karl Ferdinand Erzherzog von Österreich and Elizabeth Franziska Maria Erzherzogin von Österreich, on 29 November 1879 at Madrid, Spain. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 25 November 1885 at age 27 at El Prado, Madrid, Spain. ▼1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Alfonso XII de Borbón y de Borbón, Rey de España gained the title of Rey Alfonso XII de España in 1874.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Alfonso XII de Borbón y de Borbón, Rey de España and Elena Sanz y Martinez de Arrizala
