1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Voir [http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlotte_de_Belgique '''Wikipedia...''']
2 CONT *Full name: Marie Charlotte Amélie Augustine Victoire Clémentine Léopoldine princess of Belgium
2 CONT *By marriage empress consort of Mexico
2 CONT *Without issues
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://thepeerage.com/p10235.htm#i102341 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/W/per_page.php?id=5910 Geneall]
