1 NOTE Ludwig III, son of Prince Luitpold, after acting as Regent of the kingdom of German Bavaria from 1912 to 1913, came to rule, succeeding Otto I.  Ludwig III ruled as King from 1913 to 1918 at the end of World War I.
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis or Ludwig III became Regent of German Bavaria in 1912, after the death of his father, Prince Luitpold, Regent of Otto I.  Ludwig III was Regent until Otto died in 1913, then succeeded Otto as King of German Bavaria.
2 CONT
2 CONT King Louis or Ludwig III of German Bavaria abdicated the throne in 1918, last reigning king of the German house of Wittlesbach.
