1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ekteskap med Sara Hansdatter 19.sept.1870 (nr.8) Han var da enkemann:  https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/6789/35665/14
2 CONT
2 CONT See: http://kolstrom.net/history , "Slektshistorie".
2 CONT By Muller name Louis Philippe charmed at 22 years of age older 27-year old unexperinced Beata Katariina.
2 CONT Soon after Prince had left was noticed after 9 months she was to give birth- and gave birth secretly in Keräsjärvi Hirvaslopmpolo in a fisherman cabin a healthy boy, Erik Wahlbom. He was raised in Muonio vickery. He got name "Puol
2 CONC ikko-Erkki" - and later on moved to Norway.
2 CONT See: http://www.muonio.fi/vapaa-aika/louis-philippen-puisto.html
