1 CONT 1814-1848, into the Second Republic from 1848-1852, into the Second Empire
1 CONT under Emperor Napoleon III from 1852-1870, and finally, into the Third
1 CONT Republic  from 1871 on. Monarchy in France had died on February 24, 1848.
