0 @N6000000002322348815@ NOTE Marie-Louise-Leopoldine-Francoise-Terese-Josephine-Lucie was an Austrian
1 CONT archduchess, and the niece of Marie-Antoinette of France. She bore Napoleon a
1 CONT son, long desired heir. Though her father, Francis II, despised Napoleon as
1 CONT an upstart, he did not for reasons of state refuse him the hand in marriage of
1 CONT his daughter, Marie-Louise in 1810. Francis, however, was present at many of
1 CONT the battles of 1813-14, which finally destroyed the French Emperor's powers.
